est, for the next amendment: the Observe row of section 2 says \"C2 is not built\". C2 landed as main 26d1e65c on 14 November at 18:25 EST, after this note landed as 270dc8c7. The amendment does not touch that row, and the request does not ask for it, so this does not block.\n\nArchitecture: sound. The amendment records built steps and one ruling, and changes no design.\n\nSecurity: no finding. The pending-output rule keeps Explore from guessing an entry ID, so no unsigned body can depend on a number that the entry has not yet fixed.\n\nSimplification: no required change.\n\nThis approval authorizes no push or landing. The planner decides the landing.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:05ec8b30f3eeabf8d937d6c8f8e372865d30fdf5","binding":"assigned","head":"4314b3e7ccb478a8600159d02c039c5e05cf3803","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:e0c29e33a91db4f51356ef4699874d345d34f95a\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0eeca75b2fbccd733d61e47bb07aad9972aec073\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:e0c29e33a91db4f51356ef4699874d345d34f95a","review_path":"reviewguard@1","verdict":"approved"}}